---

3. USER SYSTEM

Database mempunyai tabel:

CREATE TABLE IF NOT EXISTS users (
    id INTEGER PRIMARY KEY AUTOINCREMENT,
    username TEXT UNIQUE NOT NULL,
    email TEXT UNIQUE NOT NULL,
    password_hash TEXT NOT NULL,
    created_at DATETIME DEFAULT CURRENT_TIMESTAMP
);

Password wajib disimpan menggunakan hashing yang aman.

Jangan menyimpan password plaintext.

---

4. SENDERS DATABASE

Buat tabel:

CREATE TABLE IF NOT EXISTS senders (
    id INTEGER PRIMARY KEY AUTOINCREMENT,

    user_id INTEGER NOT NULL,

    number TEXT NOT NULL,

    location TEXT NOT NULL DEFAULT 'private',

    status TEXT NOT NULL DEFAULT 'disconnected',

    session_path TEXT NOT NULL,

    created_at DATETIME DEFAULT CURRENT_TIMESTAMP,

    updated_at DATETIME DEFAULT CURRENT_TIMESTAMP,

    UNIQUE(user_id, number),

    FOREIGN KEY(user_id)
        REFERENCES users(id)
        ON DELETE CASCADE
);

Location hanya:

private
global

Status:

connecting
connected
disconnected
logged_out
failed

---

5. PRIVATE SENDER

Jika user login:

User ID = 15

kemudian user memasukkan:

628123456789

maka database:

user_id = 15
number = 628123456789
location = private

dan session:

sessions/
└── user_15/
    └── 628123456789/

User lain:

User ID = 20

tidak boleh mengakses:

user_15/

---

6. AUTHENTICATION

Jangan percaya "user_id" dari frontend.

Contoh request:

{
    "user_id": 15,
    "number": "628123456789"
}

JANGAN menggunakan "user_id" dari body sebagai sumber kebenaran.

Identitas user harus diambil dari:

JWT

atau:

server-side session

Contoh:

Authorization: Bearer <JWT>

Backend melakukan:

JWT
 ↓
verify
 ↓
user_id
 ↓
gunakan user_id hasil authentication

Frontend tidak boleh bisa mengganti:

user_id = 15

menjadi:

user_id = 16

untuk mengambil sender orang lain.

---

7. LOGIN

Buat:

POST /api/v1/auth/register

Body:

{
    "username": "andika",
    "email": "user@example.com",
    "password": "password"
}

Login:

POST /api/v1/auth/login

Body:

{
    "email": "user@example.com",
    "password": "password"
}

Response:

{
    "success": true,
    "token": "JWT_TOKEN",
    "user": {
        "id": 15,
        "username": "andika",
        "email": "user@example.com"
    }
}

---

8. CONNECT BOT

Frontend dashboard memiliki tombol:

CONNECT BOT

Ketika ditekan tampil modal:

Connect WhatsApp

Location:

(•) Private
( ) Global

WhatsApp Number:

[ +62xxxxxxxxxxx ]

[ CONNECT ]

Untuk mode PRIVATE, request:

POST /api/v1/bot-pairing
Authorization: Bearer JWT_TOKEN
Content-Type: application/json

Body:

{
    "number": "628123456789",
    "location": "private"
}

Backend mendapatkan:

user_id

dari JWT.

---

9. PRIVATE PAIRING FLOW

Alur lengkap:

User login
     ↓
Dashboard
     ↓
Connect Bot
     ↓
Private
     ↓
Input nomor
     ↓
POST /api/v1/bot-pairing
     ↓
verify JWT
     ↓
get authenticated user_id
     ↓
normalize number
     ↓
cek sender user tersebut
     ↓
buat database sender
     ↓
buat sessions/user_<id>/<number>
     ↓
start Baileys
     ↓
generate pairing code
     ↓
return pairing code

Response:

{
    "success": true,
    "number": "628123456789",
    "location": "private",
    "pairingCode": "ABCD1234",
    "status": "connecting"
}

Pairing code jangan disimpan permanen di database.

---

10. BAILEYS SESSION

Setiap user/sender harus memiliki authentication state terpisah.

Contoh:

sessions/
├── user_15/
│   ├── 628123456789/
│   └── 628555555555/
│
└── user_20/
    └── 628987654321/

Jangan menggunakan satu folder session untuk semua sender.

Gunakan:

useMultiFileAuthState()

dengan path:

sessions/user_<userId>/<number>

---

11. MULTI SESSION MEMORY

Gunakan:

const sessions = new Map();

Gunakan key:

userId:number

Contoh:

15:628123456789
20:628987654321

Dengan begitu nomor yang sama secara konsep tetap dapat dibedakan berdasarkan user.

Jangan membuat koneksi duplicate untuk:

15:628123456789

---

12. CONNECTION STATUS

Handle "connection.update".

Jika:

open

update database:

connected

Jika:

connecting

update:

connecting

Jika disconnected:

disconnected

Jika logout:

logged_out

Jika error:

failed

Dashboard harus menampilkan status secara real-time/polling.

---

13. AUTO RECONNECT

Ketika server restart:

database
 ↓
ambil sender
 ↓
cek session_path
 ↓
jika session ada
 ↓
reconnect Baileys

Sender yang masih valid harus otomatis reconnect.

Gunakan reconnect delay/backoff.

Contoh:

2 sec
5 sec
10 sec
30 sec

Jangan melakukan reconnect tanpa batas dengan interval sangat pendek.

Sender yang "logged_out" tidak boleh otomatis reconnect.

---

14. GET MY SENDERS

Endpoint:

GET /api/v1/my-senders
Authorization: Bearer JWT_TOKEN

Backend:

SELECT *
FROM senders
WHERE user_id = authenticatedUserId;

Response:

{
    "success": true,
    "senders": [
        {
            "id": 1,
            "number": "628123456789",
            "location": "private",
            "status": "connected"
        }
    ]
}

WAJIB menggunakan authenticated user ID.

Jangan menerima:

?user_id=...

untuk menentukan pemilik sender.

---

15. GET SENDER STATUS

Endpoint:

GET /api/v1/sender/:number/status
Authorization: Bearer JWT_TOKEN

Backend wajib mencari:

user_id = authenticated user
number = :number

Bukan hanya:

number = :number

Jika sender bukan milik user:

403 Forbidden

Response:

{
    "success": false,
    "message": "You do not own this sender"
}

---

16. SEND MESSAGE

Endpoint:

POST /api/v1/send-message
Authorization: Bearer JWT_TOKEN
Content-Type: application/json

Body:

{
    "target": "628111111111",
    "sender": "628123456789",
    "jenis": "text",
    "message": "Halo!"
}

Alur:

JWT
 ↓
authenticated user_id
 ↓
sender dari request
 ↓
database
 ↓
WHERE user_id = authenticatedUserId
AND number = sender
 ↓
cek ownership
 ↓
cek status
 ↓
ambil socket
 ↓
func.js
 ↓
send message

Jika sender milik user lain:

403 Forbidden

---

17. JENIS PESAN

Hanya gunakan jenis pesan normal:

text
image
video
audio
document

Jangan membuat:

bug
crash
flood
spam
payload attack
void attack
delay attack

atau fungsi yang bertujuan mengganggu WhatsApp/perangkat/akun target.

---

18. FUNC.JS

Buat:

export async function sendText(sock, target, message) {}

export async function sendImage(sock, target, url, caption) {}

export async function sendVideo(sock, target, url, caption) {}

export async function sendAudio(sock, target, url) {}

export async function sendDocument(sock, target, url, filename) {}

Semua fungsi harus menggunakan API resmi Baileys yang sesuai.

---

19. LOGOUT

Endpoint:

POST /api/v1/sender/:number/logout
Authorization: Bearer JWT_TOKEN

Backend wajib:

authenticated user
 ↓
cari sender WHERE user_id = currentUser
 ↓
logout
 ↓
hapus socket dari Map
 ↓
update status

User tidak boleh logout sender milik user lain.

Optional body:

{
    "deleteSession": true
}

Jika true:

sessions/user_<id>/<number>

dihapus.

Jika false:

session tetap disimpan.

---

20. GLOBAL SENDER

Sistem juga harus mendukung:

location = global

Tetapi GLOBAL berbeda dengan PRIVATE.

PRIVATE:

hanya pemilik sender

GLOBAL:

hanya dapat digunakan jika user mempunyai permission

Tambahkan field:

role

pada user:

user
admin

Contoh:

PRIVATE
User A → sender A

GLOBAL
Admin → dapat mengelola sender global
User biasa → tidak dapat menggunakan sender global kecuali diberi permission

Jangan membuat global sender otomatis dapat dipakai semua user tanpa authorization.

---

21. API ADMIN

Buat endpoint:

GET /api/v1/admin/senders

Hanya admin.

Admin dapat melihat:

user
number
location
status
created_at

Admin dapat:

disconnect
logout
delete sender

Tetapi jangan pernah mengembalikan authentication credentials/session state.

